  "evaluation_view": "single_video_topic_evidence",
  "evidence_question": "该视频的完整原字幕是否实质讨论了 MCP？",
  "full_raw_transcript": [
    {
      "end_time": 1.38,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000001",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 0.08,
      "text": "哈喽下班啦",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 3.14,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000002",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 1.38,
      "text": "今天聊一个话题哈",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 4.84,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000003",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 3.14,
      "text": "好的想法从哪儿来",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 6.44,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000004",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 4.84,
      "text": "为什么讲这个事儿呢",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 9.65,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000005",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 6.44,
      "text": "就是因为最近一段时间",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 12.45,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000006",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 9.65,
      "text": "戚薇不是上线了一个AI助手吗",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 14.539,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000007",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 12.45,
      "text": "他的名字叫大元啊",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 16.359,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000008",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 14.539,
      "text": "就是非常亲切的一个名字",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 20.259,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000009",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 16.359,
      "text": "然后我们很幸运的成了第一批内测用户哈",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 23.8,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000010",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 20.259,
      "text": "这个助手呢实际上给我们挺多惊喜的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 28.06,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000011",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 23.8,
      "text": "因为嗯本来以为就是一个类似于一个",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 29.58,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000012",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 28.06,
      "text": "跟其他的拆GBT也好",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 32.34,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000013",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 29.58,
      "text": "没啥区别的这么一个AI的对话助手",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 36.04,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000014",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 32.34,
      "text": "但是呢这次的因为是他在你的工作空间中",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 39.04,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000015",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 36.04,
      "text": "是在你的工作上下文中给你提供服务的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 43.16,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000016",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 39.04,
      "text": "所以呢他会挖掘出来一些你没有想象的东西",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 44.12,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000017",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 43.16,
      "text": "而这些东西呢",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 46.43,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000018",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 44.12,
      "text": "可能是你工作过程中没有注意到的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 48.25,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000019",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 46.43,
      "text": "就是你注意力没有cover的东西",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 50.21,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000020",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 48.25,
      "text": "我就觉得诶挺有意思",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 53.44,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000021",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 50.21,
      "text": "就是从很多这种细碎的一条一条的信息中",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 56.54,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000022",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 53.44,
      "text": "它反而是可以汇聚出来很多很有意思的洞察",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 60.37,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000023",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 56.54,
      "text": "然后这个是我这两天使用大圆儿的一个体验哈",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 61.49,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000024",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 60.37,
      "text": "就是周末的时候",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 63.75,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000025",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 61.49,
      "text": "本来中午躺在床上是要睡午觉的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 65.939,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000026",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 63.75,
      "text": "结果开始跟大人对话",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 67.779,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000027",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 65.939,
      "text": "然后开始挖群里的信息",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 70.639,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000028",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 67.779,
      "text": "去让他帮我总结大家有哪些观察和视角",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 72.93,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000029",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 70.639,
      "text": "能不能给我一些有启发的洞察",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 76.01,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000030",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 72.93,
      "text": "诶发现确实是有这样的一个作用哈",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 78.61,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000031",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 76.01,
      "text": "当然我们群里的很多讨论都是非常高质量的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 81.42,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000032",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 78.61,
      "text": "就这一条一条的信息本身就是高质量的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 83.86,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000033",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 81.42,
      "text": "所以就是还挺意外的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 87.81,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000034",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 83.86,
      "text": "甚至是他还启发了我可以做一些新的研究选题",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 90.09,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000035",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 87.81,
      "text": "我觉得这个真的是切没有想到",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 92.21,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000036",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 90.09,
      "text": "然后那好的想法从哪儿来呢",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 96.29,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000037",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 92.21,
      "text": "我觉得其实就是从这种细碎的一点一点的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 98.83,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000038",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 96.29,
      "text": "非常细枝末节的这种观察中",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 100.83,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000039",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 98.83,
      "text": "就可以产生一些很好的想法",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 103.239,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000040",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 100.83,
      "text": "而这些想法不是宏大叙事",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 106.689,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000041",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 103.239,
      "text": "不是自上而下的这种宏观视角的推演",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 108.909,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000042",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 106.689,
      "text": "而是说真的是从你的身边来",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 111.26,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000043",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 108.909,
      "text": "从每一天的思考中来",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 113.54,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000044",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 111.26,
      "text": "从跟不同的人对话中来",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 117.04,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000045",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 113.54,
      "text": "然后从你的一点点的生命的体悟和观察中来",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 120.12,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000046",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 117.04,
      "text": "所以我觉得这个从真实世界中是可以启发出",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 122.34,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000047",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 120.12,
      "text": "非常好多的好的观点的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 123.44,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000048",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 122.34,
      "text": "好的想法的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 126.26,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000049",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 123.44,
      "text": "但是很多时候我们其实是把这些好的想法",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 128.7,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000050",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 126.26,
      "text": "好的观点给忽略掉了对吧",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 131.29,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000051",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 128.7,
      "text": "就是嗯你都来不及去想",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 133.82,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000052",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 131.29,
      "text": "因为我们的注意力实在是太稀缺了",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 137.52,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000053",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 133.82,
      "text": "就是我们都会聚焦在那些即时的事情上",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 138.48,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000054",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 137.52,
      "text": "什么时候饿了",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 139.22,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000055",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 138.48,
      "text": "什么时候困了",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 141.41,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000056",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 139.22,
      "text": "什么时候想喝水了对吧",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 144.15,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000057",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 141.41,
      "text": "有有很多这种支持生物发展的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 146.9,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000058",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 144.15,
      "text": "时间是被消耗掉了",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 149.74,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000059",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 146.9,
      "text": "那还有一些时间是被一些工作任务消耗掉了",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 152.48,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000060",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 149.74,
      "text": "但是往往那些创意是来自于",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 155.53,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000061",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 152.48,
      "text": "不经意间的一个想法对吧",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 158.85,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000062",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 155.53,
      "text": "然后非常偶然的一个念头",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 161.55,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000063",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 158.85,
      "text": "但往往是这些念头是很难捕捉的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 163.79,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000064",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 161.55,
      "text": "但是可能在跟大家的对话中",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 167.05,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000065",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 163.79,
      "text": "在一些奇怪的场景的讨论中",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 170.93,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000066",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 167.05,
      "text": "在一些呃特别细枝末节的哎呀",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 171.97,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000067",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 170.93,
      "text": "下雨了",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 175.09,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000068",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 171.97,
      "text": "细枝末节的一些想法中",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 178.21,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000069",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 175.09,
      "text": "能够产生这样的一些内容啊",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 180.91,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000070",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 178.21,
      "text": "我要把这个伞打开",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 191.84,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000071",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 187.78,
      "text": "对所以打着伞继续讲对",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 194.54,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000072",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 191.84,
      "text": "然后所以其实像这样的一点一滴的思考",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 197.95,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000073",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 194.54,
      "text": "我觉得是非常有价值的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 199.99,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000074",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 197.95,
      "text": "但是往往又是容易被忽略掉的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 202.35,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000075",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 199.99,
      "text": "所以我觉得戚薇这次的这个大圆哈",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 205.709,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000076",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 202.35,
      "text": "他在你工作空间中出现的这么一个工作助手",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 209.899,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000077",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 205.709,
      "text": "可以让你在这个忙了一周之后哈",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 214.119,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000078",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 209.899,
      "text": "还可以回顾那些点滴的讨论和思想的火花",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 216.81,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000079",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 214.119,
      "text": "我觉得这个对于我们做研究工作来说就非常好",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 219.9,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000080",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 216.81,
      "text": "特别是来自不同领域的一些碰撞",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 222.08,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000081",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 219.9,
      "text": "甚至是不同群聊中的一些观点哈",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 224.94,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000082",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 222.08,
      "text": "他都会对你的主线产生一些启发",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 229.04,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000083",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 224.94,
      "text": "所以我觉得这个从发芽到这个织网",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 230.32,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000084",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 229.04,
      "text": "再到沉淀",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 231.52,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000085",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 230.32,
      "text": "再到行动对吧",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 233.32,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000086",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 231.52,
      "text": "我觉得这个路径如果能跑通的话",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 236.5,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000087",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 233.32,
      "text": "真的是一个非常好的AI的助手对",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 238.32,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000088",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 236.5,
      "text": "然后当然现在还在内测中",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 239.4,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000089",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 238.32,
      "text": "席位还在内测中",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 242.04,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000090",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 239.4,
      "text": "那后续呢也希望他们能有更多的",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 245.24,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000091",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 242.04,
      "text": "比较好的一些新的功能出现",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 246.44,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000092",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 245.24,
      "text": "然后我今天也问了",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 248.88,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000093",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 246.44,
      "text": "他们会在WAIC大会上",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 251.81,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000094",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 248.88,
      "text": "就是在7月17到19号",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 253.57,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000095",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 251.81,
      "text": "上海世界人工智大会上",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 255.15,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000096",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 253.57,
      "text": "他们也会有个展台",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 257.99,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000097",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 255.15,
      "text": "大家有兴趣的话可以去看一看",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 261.07,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000098",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 257.99,
      "text": "因为他们正好今天也发了AI硬件",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 263.409,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000099",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 261.07,
      "text": "就是一个录音笔",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 264.449,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000100",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 263.409,
      "text": "不能叫录音笔",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 266.25,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000101",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 264.449,
      "text": "就是一个录音的壳子",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 269.29,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000102",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 266.25,
      "text": "有点像在你手机后面贴着的一个录音的壳子",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 271.09,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000103",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 269.29,
      "text": "然后可以帮你记录面聊",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 273.15,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000104",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 271.09,
      "text": "可以帮你记录这个组织的上下文",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 275.69,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000105",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 273.15,
      "text": "我觉得大家可以去体验一下",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    },
    {
      "end_time": 277.56,
      "segment_id": "BV1zDTX6eEGu_seg_000106",
      "source_artifact_id": "raw_subtitle:BV1zDTX6eEGu:p1",
      "source_language": "zh",
      "source_type": "raw_subtitle",
      "source_version": "sha256:f8e66789b120495738e2d0c9223107ffea348b70f0882a6f5f2c4ae27600361a",
      "start_time": 275.69,
      "text": "到时候嗯拜拜",
      "timeline_run_id": "timeline_f8e66789b1204957"
    }
  ],
